    "profile_text": {
        "body": "AeroVironment Inc is a public company headquartered in Arlington, Virginia, traded under the ticker AVAV. According to its website, it describes itself as a leading manufacturer of Unmanned Aircraft Systems, Unmanned Aerial Vehicles, Loitering Munition Systems, and Unmanned Ground Vehicles used for surveillance and reconnaissance by the United States Military, U.S. allies, and commercial industries. It also states that it manufactures High-Altitude Pseudo-Satellites.\n\nThe site describes MacCready Works as the company's advanced development group, which it says turns concepts into mission-ready autonomous systems. The company says its engineers, roboticists, and AI researchers design next-generation robotic systems across air, land, and sea, guided by what it calls the MacCready Method: build fast, test relentlessly, deploy advantage. It credits the group's name and approach to the pioneering spirit of Dr. Paul B. MacCready, Jr.\n\nThe company's record lists no tracked products, no lawsuits, and no MCP servers. Its law exposure is recorded in Virginia, with a count of 152.",
